WEBVTT

00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:05.860
Hino-chan Special Attack!

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:10.150
Alright!

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.450
Nice one, Akane!

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.720
That's what we need for the next match, Hino!

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.430
You got it, Coach!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:25.090
<i>The name's Hino Akane! I'm an eighth-grader who dazzles like the sun!</i>

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:26.510
Akane-chan!

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:30.840
Good luck in your match! We'll be there to cheer you on!

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.080
<i>Oh, yeah, I'm also a Precure legendary warrior, along with Miyuki and a few other classmates.</i>

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.310
<i>But that's our little secret, 'kay?</i>

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:44.150
I'm full of hot-blooded power today!

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:46.020
Let's do this thing!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.530
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:52.400
Smile Precure!

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:53.270
Let's go!

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.800
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:55.930
All together!

00:00:56.170 --> 00:00:57.540
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.740
Jump to tomorrow!

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.410
Smile Precure!

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.250
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:12.720
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:17.890
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:23.820
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:24.190 --> 00:01:28.700
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:28.150 --> 00:01:28.700
So bright!

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:33.950
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:34.290 --> 00:01:40.040
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:38.290 --> 00:01:40.880
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:01:41.380 --> 00:01:42.040
Let's go!

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.630
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:47.670
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:01:48.010 --> 00:01:52.470
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:01:51.840 --> 00:01:53.050
Girls! Let's go!

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:54.600
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:55.810
Everybody!

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:57.310
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.060
Fly to the future!

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:03.560
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:05.670
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:08.040
Smile Precure!

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:16.170
Mornin'!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.080
Good morning, Akane-chan!

00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:23.180
What're you up to? Hidin' something, are we?

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.490
O-Of course not, Akane-chan!

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:28.690
Miyuki, your fingers!

00:02:28.690 --> 00:02:30.150
The heck did you do to them?!

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:33.290
O-Oh, nothing at all!

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:37.320
Lemme guess. Somebody messed dinner up last night, didn't they?

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:38.560
Y-Yeah, that's it...

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:41.400
Ya really are a klutz, you know that? Ya've gotta be more careful!

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:46.770
Oh, homeroom's about to start! Come on!

00:02:48.940 --> 00:02:54.110
The theme of this year's School Creativity Contest is going to be "Personal Treasures".

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:57.380
Does anyone here have something they cherish?

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.810
Treasures, huh?

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.750
Sounds kinda fun!

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.840
You got anything good, Miyuki?

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.160
Well, umm...

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:05.060
It's gotta be my guitar!

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.990
When I'm not sleeping or at school, I'm playing it!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:09.990
Mine's definitely my telescope!

00:03:09.990 --> 00:03:14.340
For me, it's the matching keyholders Mayu and I got on that field trip!

00:03:14.340 --> 00:03:15.970
Mine's my judo black belt!

00:03:15.970 --> 00:03:17.810
My game save data!

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:20.400
That hardly counts as a treasure, does it?

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.370
It doesn't?!

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:25.530
Didn't expect so many quick answers...

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:26.710
What about yours, Akane-chan?

00:03:26.710 --> 00:03:29.660
Dunno, really! Never really thought about it...

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.120
But now I want one!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:35.520
Time for me to find myself a treasure!

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:51.400
Joker!

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:55.570
The heck do you want, calling me out like this?

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:57.480
What do <i>I</i> want?

00:03:57.480 --> 00:04:03.580
Maybe I can help you appreciate your personal situation in this matter.

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:11.360
You've completely failed to defeat even a single Precure, and Pierrot is <i>furious.</i>

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:16.390
W-Well maybe he should get off his butt and revive already, then!

00:04:16.390 --> 00:04:19.030
Maybe you could bother tellin' us what Pierrot actually—

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.700
<i>Wolfrun-san.</i>

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:23.640
Are you that eager to return to how you were in the past?

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:26.240
Pick a card.

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:30.210
I'm sure even you must be able to defeat one Precure.

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:33.300
But this will be your final chance!

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:46.420
Cure Sunny, is it?

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:49.560
I've got a bone to pick with her!

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:56.980
The best of luck to you, then.

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.340
Treasure, treasure...

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.540
What are your treasures. anyway?

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:07.270
Mine's a copy of Cinderella my grandma gave me as a child.

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:08.810
Gotta be my soccer cleats!

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.950
The photo that I took with Taiyouman!

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:14.720
Our household has a scroll that's been passed down through generations!

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:17.190
I like the Royal Clock-kuru!

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:20.060
Let's Go: Ring!

00:05:20.060 --> 00:05:21.330
So pretty-kuru!

00:05:21.330 --> 00:05:25.060
Heh, guess you guys figured yours out quickly!

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:27.700
But, ya know... what counts as a treasure anyway?

00:05:27.700 --> 00:05:31.100
Well, it'd be something you hold dear, right?

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.340
Something you're proud of!

00:05:32.570 --> 00:05:34.670
A thing of sentimental value.

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:39.000
I guess it is kinda tricky to put your finger on it.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.280
But...

00:05:40.560 --> 00:05:44.120
Something that excites you, that you never want to lose, I guess?

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.120
Something I never wanna lose...

00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:50.520
You're passionate about so many things, Akane-chan! I'm sure you'll find something!

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:53.320
Oh, right! The stuff I like can gimme inspiration!

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.020
Now we're talkin'!

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.700
That's the spirit!

00:06:05.570 --> 00:06:08.910
<i>I guess volleyball's what I like most!</i>

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:12.780
<i>Would that mean my treasure's an actual volleyball, though?</i>

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:16.830
What're you doin' up there, Miyuki?

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.220
Go for it, Akane-chan!

00:06:21.460 --> 00:06:22.920
Akane-chan, behind you!

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:29.990
<i>Yeah, I like playin' volleyball... but the ball ain't 'xactly a treasure...</i>

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:39.500
You've really made that twirl your own, haven't you, Akane-chan?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:40.340
Sure have!

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:47.210
<i>Okonomiyaki's definitely up there on the things I like!</i>

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:50.730
Does that make these my treasure...?

00:06:50.730 --> 00:06:52.610
Nah, not really...

00:06:53.190 --> 00:06:54.480
Welcome!

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:55.980
Hi there!

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.120
Guys! Come on in!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.150
You can take a break if ya want, Akane.

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.300
Really?

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:04.330
Oh, some letter came for ya written in English, too.

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.580
A letter...?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:06.820
In English?!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:07.970
It must be from...

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:09.830
...Brian!

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:11.200
Seriously?!

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:14.890
"Dear Akane"...?

00:07:14.890 --> 00:07:15.840
What's "Dear" mean?

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:18.630
It denotes how important you are to him.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:21.010
That's... kinda really embarassing!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:25.180
L-Look here! It says "like"!

00:07:25.180 --> 00:07:27.220
Like?! As in, he <i>likes</i> you?!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.140
Is he confessing his love?!

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:30.830
D-Don't be silly...

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:36.530
I believe in this instance, "like" is a comparitive. He's comparing your smile to the sun.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:38.880
Aww, come on!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:39.560
Boo-kuru!

00:07:40.010 --> 00:07:42.220
My smile's like the sun, huh...?

00:07:42.220 --> 00:07:44.070
What's that smile for, Akane-chan?

00:07:44.640 --> 00:07:45.770
I-I'm not—!

00:07:45.790 --> 00:07:47.910
Does that make you happy, Akane-kuru?

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:54.480
Well, it's true! When Akane smiles, it really brightens up your day!

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:57.280
The sun is a perfect comparison, I believe.

00:07:57.280 --> 00:07:59.660
Thanks, guys, but this is really embarassin'!

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.790
Maybe that letter can be your treasure-kuru!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.140
I think somebody's said a little too much, Candy!

00:08:08.140 --> 00:08:10.960
Coochiecoochiecoo!

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.170
But, ya know...

00:08:15.170 --> 00:08:20.720
I've been doin' a lot of thinkin' about what my treasure is, but I still dunno...

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:28.280
There's stacks of things that I love, but I can't think of somethin' I'd really call a <i>treasure,</i> ya know?

00:08:32.290 --> 00:08:33.480
I'll see ya tomorrow!

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:38.220
Well, the thing is, Akane...

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:41.590
We actually came to give you this.

00:08:42.810 --> 00:08:43.710
Did you...

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:46.700
Did you make this for me?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.900
Good luck at your match tomorrow, Akane-kuru!

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:53.870
Wait, Miyuki, is this how you hurt your hand?!

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:58.580
Oh, this? Yeah, I'm not that great at sewing...

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:04.270
Akane-chan?!

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:06.560
Thanks, you guys...

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.150
Seriously, thank you so much!

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:13.210
I love it! You guys rock!

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:15.660
Thank you, thank you, thank you, thank you!

00:09:15.660 --> 00:09:17.960
I'm just glad you like it!

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.160
Well, of course I'm going to like it!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:24.000
Miyuki-chan said we should make some kind of good luck charm for your match.

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.140
Really, Miyuki?!

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:28.840
Yayoi-chan came up with the design!

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.840
I know, I know, it's not that great!

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:34.250
Reika-chan picked out the best materials for us.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:36.950
Then Nao-chan taught us how to sew it all together!

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.800
And we all did that together!

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.520
I helped stitch too-kuru!

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:43.490
You sure did!

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:44.520
Stitchety-stitch!

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:45.320
Yep!

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:46.790
I did my very best-kuru!

00:09:47.680 --> 00:09:49.000
This is it...

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:55.130
This is my treasure, no doubt about it!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:58.840
Alright then! Make sure you rock that match tomorrow!

00:10:01.060 --> 00:10:02.540
You betcha!

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:08.280
I've finally found my treasure...

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:13.410
This is the best! The best feeling!

00:10:20.810 --> 00:10:22.690
Man, look at that stitchin'!

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:25.030
I guess Miyuki did that bit!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:29.170
The neat bits must be Nao...? Or maybe Reika?

00:10:29.930 --> 00:10:32.410
And look at the detail on that volleyball!

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:36.140
Oh, so that's why Yayoi was sketching that volleyball!

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:40.110
This is it! Something that excites me, that I never wanna lose!

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:45.650
No, more than that... just havin' it with me makes me feel so much stronger!

00:10:47.090 --> 00:10:50.060
I'm gonna give that match both barrels!

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:57.530
<i>Cure Sunny...</i>

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:01.500
<i>I'm going to destroy everything you hold dear...</i>

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:08.670
Sunny!

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:15.670
Sunny!

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:24.010
<i>Alright! Let's do this thing!</i>

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:31.920
I've been waiting for you, Cure Sunny!

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.590
What the heck are you doin' here?!

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:38.230
I've come to settle things with you, one-on-one!

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.630
What?!

00:11:51.640 --> 00:11:54.110
Why'd you do that to them?!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:58.460
I'm going to destroy everything you've ever cared about.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.750
Say your prayers.

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:05.470
Ready?

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:08.900
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:09.930
Go!

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.710
Go, go!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.510
Let's go: Sunny!

00:12:37.850 --> 00:12:39.570
Dazzling sun!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:41.570
Hot-blooded power!

00:12:42.820 --> 00:12:44.210
Cure Sunny!

00:12:46.930 --> 00:12:48.800
Here I come, Cure Sunny!

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:52.090
Come on out, Hyper Akanbe!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.610
Hyper Akanbe!

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:08.240
Huh? Ain't that...

00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:11.450
It's just like the first Akanbe I ever fought!

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.150
Man, you're runnin' out of ideas!

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.020
Am I now?

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:21.560
We'll see about that once I've crushed that stupid smile of yours off your face once and for all!

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.200
Here I come!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.990
Hyper!

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:27.970
Akan!

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.550
I can't even begin to explain how much I hate you!

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.830
You're always smiling about something, trying to bring people together!

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:03.340
Well I hate your smiles! Actually, I hate everything about you and your little brat friends!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:06.970
So, I'm going to crush each and every one of you!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.020
What the heck...?

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:19.020
Akanbe...

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.190
It's a Bad End Zone!

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.610
Right by the gymnasium, too.

00:14:23.610 --> 00:14:25.970
Wait, then Akane's fighting alone!

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:26.980
We've gotta hurry!

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:31.490
Akanbe!

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.710
What's this little thing?

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:41.680
That's my treasure!

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:44.250
This is a treasure?!

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:47.020
This stupid little piece of fluff?!

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:53.190
Don't you dare! My friends made that just for me! Ain't nothin' can replace it!

00:14:53.790 --> 00:14:56.290
God, you really are stupid.

00:14:57.760 --> 00:14:58.840
Give that back!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.060
Give it a rest!

00:15:04.870 --> 00:15:08.570
I told you. I'm going to destroy everything...

00:15:08.060 --> 00:15:09.210
No!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.970
...you've ever cared about!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:15.970
Don't!

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:26.590
The very thought of this lame thing being anyone's treasure is hilarious!

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:42.770
It's time to say goodbye!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.140
<i>Akane-chan!</i>

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:56.830
<i>Good luck in your match! We'll be there to cheer you on!</i>

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:59.350
<i>Yeah, I'm not that great at sewing...</i>

00:15:59.580 --> 00:16:04.180
<i>Miyuki-chan said we should make some kind of good luck charm for your match.</i>

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:07.370
<i>I helped stitch too-kuru!</i>

00:16:12.460 --> 00:16:14.310
How could I let him...

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.840
...destroy my treasure...

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:22.410
God, that's the worst treasure I've ever seen!

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:27.560
I should have taken you Precure runts out one by one to start with!

00:16:27.560 --> 00:16:29.080
Let's see...

00:16:29.680 --> 00:16:31.150
...how about Cure Happy next?

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:40.690
I won't...

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:44.100
I won't let you...

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:49.470
I will never let you...!

00:16:53.290 --> 00:16:55.110
Get back here!

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.120
You're goin' nowhere...

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:10.290
Look who's shaking!

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:13.070
<i>Yeah, I can't stop shaking...</i>

00:17:13.070 --> 00:17:16.290
<i>But when I think about losing them...</i>

00:17:18.820 --> 00:17:21.190
Seriously? We're still doing this?!

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:30.450
You've already lost! Just stay there and shut up!

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:32.950
No way! I ain't lettin' you hurt them!

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:36.450
Because now I know they're my real treasures!

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:38.770
Volleyball, okonomiyaki...

00:17:38.770 --> 00:17:42.970
All the things I do, I enjoy because of them!

00:17:42.970 --> 00:17:48.400
It's havin' them around that lets me enjoy life the way I do!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.600
Oh, shut up!

00:17:52.360 --> 00:17:55.370
You're just some wimpy little brat who can't do anything by herself!

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:58.230
Don't you dare talk down to me!

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:00.280
Hyper!

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.950
With them at my side, I'm a hundred...

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:07.620
...no, a thousand times stronger!

00:18:08.680 --> 00:18:11.490
Because they're the best treasures...

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:15.290
...I could ever want!

00:18:26.970 --> 00:18:30.520
They're the treasures I never want to lose...

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.610
...and I won't let you take them from me!

00:18:35.780 --> 00:18:37.720
You repugnant brat!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:42.100
I'm not gonna lose! I have no choice but to win!

00:18:58.350 --> 00:19:00.060
Precure...

00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:07.220
Sunny Fire...

00:19:10.340 --> 00:19:12.980
Burning!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.010
Die!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:40.110
Are you alright, Sunny?!

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:41.080
You guys...

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:51.210
We're not gonna let you lay another finger on our friend!

00:19:51.220 --> 00:19:57.090
Make my day! I'll destroy you all here and now!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:58.990
C'mon, let's take him down!

00:19:58.990 --> 00:20:00.180
Right!

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:06.250
Reveal your secrets, Royal Clock!

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:10.410
Combine our powers together!

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:17.770
May the light of hope shine!

00:20:18.130 --> 00:20:21.620
Let it soar to a radiant future!

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:23.950
Precure...

00:20:24.290 --> 00:20:27.780
Royal Rainbow...

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:30.240
Burst!

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:42.340
Shine, Happy Smiles!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.490
Another new Décor!

00:20:50.210 --> 00:20:51.310
I lost...

00:20:51.720 --> 00:20:55.020
What's he gonna do to me...?

00:21:01.910 --> 00:21:05.990
Sorry, guys... you worked so hard to make this for me...

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:08.770
It's alright! We can make you a new one!

00:21:08.770 --> 00:21:09.700
Right?

00:21:10.570 --> 00:21:13.360
Hopefully I'll do a better job this time, too!

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:18.430
Thanks, but... I'd like to keep this one.

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:23.630
It's my own irreplacable little treasure...

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:27.360
And it taught me what really matters to me...

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:31.550
<i>If only I'd realized before it got broken...</i>

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:36.960
I think I've finally found my own treasure!

00:21:38.440 --> 00:21:39.800
Ooh, what, what?

00:21:39.800 --> 00:21:42.860
Sorry, I ain't tellin'!

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:56.180
<i>The name's Hino Akane. I'm an eighth-grader who dazzles like the sun — and has awesome friends!</i>

00:21:56.580 --> 00:22:02.300
<i>I'm always full of hot-blooded power! Let's do this thing!</i>

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:41.490
What're you drawing, Yayoi-chan?

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:43.040
Don't look!

00:23:44.100 --> 00:23:45.530
But it's so good!

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:46.840
You did this all yourself, Yayoi-chan?

00:23:46.840 --> 00:23:48.120
What exactly are you drawing?

00:23:48.120 --> 00:23:50.940
Well, it's a manga about a superheroine I designed...

00:23:50.940 --> 00:23:53.480
Whoa! You could totally be a pro manga artist!

00:23:53.480 --> 00:23:55.850
You really think so...?

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:57.980
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.160 --> 00:24:04.020
Find your ultra happy smile!
